Package: tmog-rapl-gate
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: taskmanagerog, pkexec
Maintainer: Kevin Cherry <17479255+kcherry497@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Open RAPL energy counters only while Task Manager TMOG runs
 Since kernel 5.10 (CVE-2020-8694, PLATYPUS) /sys/class/powercap/*/energy_uj
 is readable only by root, so TMOG's Power panel shows "Access denied" for
 normal users. This add-on wraps tmog-task-manager: on launch a polkit-gated
 root helper grants read access, and when the last TMOG instance exits it
 restores root-only access. No udev rule, no group, no boot-time change.
 TMOG itself is not modified; its binary is diverted to tmog-task-manager.real.
